效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4909,"end":4917,"target_id":"1c9421a46294c266754e287319a2ef6e7a350301fe93cf8d4b334bd9191522cd","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4917,"end":5045,"target_id":"320b06a302f4a496535176d0b9e0c2bd2f6a9208106705ab8d87421549d51ef4","source_hash":"b76e3f82c80e2c386a2f3de456a227ec732b8cd5c7959aa24e4a9b1c3a80120e","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至③ 已省略\n\n  ④ 总统安全保障措施委员会条例修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第四款正文和第四条第二款第八项中，“参谋长联席会议作战司令部作战主任”应改为“参谋长联席会议作战司令部作战主任”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5045,"end":5089,"target_id":"e1e24263576757322dc2994203c74c86443f8cab17a5c577ec0c9dbe5fbb78b5","source_hash":"8dd751a8f793c9be84d77587efbbdd32656a07f837b99018f16aaa6d3d6fe6dc","text":"补充规定 <第18482号，2004年7月24日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5089,"end":5133,"target_id":"7c28b4addeaf799956c1c08c649b6decb34efc90e822ffd5b95f62191b2e0bcd","source_hash":"52dc04c85c874908c4bb43111b5482eaf75224ad02263fa556dc2b8b60e8f215","text":"补充规定 <第19835号，2007年1月18日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5133,"end":5179,"target_id":"7e830dbecf69cbbdb1dd0bb2c86b157e86a1fff3a6351e4182977429a25efe7d","source_hash":"0dd84bf0289586832492e3d03993ef07c486aac023d0a6aa88e36bee8b21fcf3","text":"增补文件（总统安全法实施令等）<第20732号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5179,"end":5208,"target_id":"5bbb01a7c9194efcd1d27f0d6d3beb892576bc31c756af7a8abdaec9e0ab485d","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5208,"end":5267,"target_id":"cc59f37ee0fc44a2c90040f0f3c0afecc60e0d9b4ce4b3d654d23009729962ae","source_hash":"89c11ed7a08a18e97d7a3dcff5518685a5927fee181a3b93ab28c0c665dc4959","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 总统安全保障措施委员会条例修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5267,"end":5314,"target_id":"93c76db31ecccb3576b7e48d4827500e6ae674692e4b2f8ad9c68739fe7c12ad","source_hash":"7c559bf913e71883a55e843c320a1c33f0fd13bd3970895e3a3b545aeb2608cc","text":"  第 1 条中的“总统安全局法”应改为“总统安全法”等。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5314,"end":5711,"target_id":"d683e58f6d468edb295d4c96c0b57d5f62c2fa251118b1d2b011cd0f42b8408a","source_hash":"1d57d01cff20236d3093fbf4ba3d58468f22bb54f2797abe0e8c1b0532938239","text":"  在第二条中，“移民局局长”应改为“移民和外国人政策本部部长”，“文化和观光部”应改为“文化、体育和观光部”，“信息通信部电信、广播和电视政策本部部长兼建设和交通部铁路规划局局长”应改为“韩国通信委员会广播和电信政策室主任兼国土交通部航空和铁路局局长”。\n\n  第四条第二款第一项中，“总统安全保卫处处长”应改为“总统安全保卫处处长”；同款第四项中，“移民局局长”应改为“移民与外交政策本部处长”；同款第六项中，“文化观光部”应改为“文化体育观光部”；同款第七项中，“信息通信部电信、广播政策本部处长”应改为“韩国通信委员会广播电信政策室处长”；同款第八项中，“建设交通部铁路企划处处长”应改为“国土交通海洋部航空铁路局处长”。\n\n  第六条第二款中的“总统安全局”应改为“总统安全办公室”。\n\n  ④ 和 ⑤ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5711,"end":5719,"target_id":"4d49f9bd27ca38bf969181e4ff9c5005c16dc8953edadddfb6119c9fc1af5c9a","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5719,"end":5764,"target_id":"2f893678cc059a63f1de5cb1fe16a7b8b0a8151ad01297f54cb6d7c3df9c5774","source_hash":"b88e16e3e18c725c0c544e10ec64f1e5af1b3d9106aa9cdda40215ea3416ce8c","text":"补充规定 <第21092号，2008年10月28日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003330-288383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5764,"end":5805,"target_id":"a8627aa264094a51678aebc635e5682fc9b89d0b72fd2a6bdef143958ce745eb","source_hash":"b846